{{#> emailLayout}}
<div class="eyebrow" style="font-size:11.5px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:0.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#F07A3F; margin-bottom:14px;">Email change &middot; current address</div>
<h2 class="heading" style="margin:0 0 16px; font-size:25px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-0.015em; line-height:1.15; color:#FAF4EA;">Is this really you?</h2>
<p class="greeting" style="margin:0 0 10px; font-size:16px; line-height:1.65; color:#FAF4EA;">Hi <strong style="font-weight:700;">{{name}}</strong>,</p>
<p class="lead" style="margin:0 auto 28px; max-width:380px; font-size:16px; line-height:1.65; color:#C9BBA8;">You asked to change the email on your account. Enter this code to confirm it&rsquo;s you, then we&rsquo;ll help you add the new address.</p>
<div class="code-label" style="font-size:12px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#9A8973; margin-bottom:14px;">Your confirmation code</div>
<div style="margin-bottom:14px;"><span class="code-chip" style="display:inline-block; font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace; font-size:33px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.34em; text-indent:0.34em; padding:16px 26px; border-radius:14px; background:#1E1611; border:2px solid #C24E22; color:#FAF4EA; box-shadow:0 8px 26px rgba(226,98,42,0.28);">{{verificationCode}}</span></div>
<p class="expiry" style="margin:0 0 26px; font-size:13px; color:#9A8973;">This code expires in 10 minutes.</p>
<div class="safety" style="padding:15px 18px; border-radius:12px; background:#20160F; border:1px solid #322823; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#C9BBA8;"><strong class="safety-accent" style="color:#F07A3F; font-weight:700;">A quick safety note:</strong> never share this code, not even with us. If you didn&rsquo;t ask to change your email, you can safely ignore this. Your address stays as it is.</div>
{{#*inline "footerReason"}}You&rsquo;re getting this because an email change was requested for this account.{{/inline}}
{{/emailLayout}}
